1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,519
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:03,020
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,311 --> 00:00:05,395
(Episode 45)

4
00:00:07,686 --> 00:00:10,236
Where did you hear such nonsense
to make you act like this?

5
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:11,850
Can't you keep your voice down?

6
00:00:11,936 --> 00:00:14,394
Why are you yelling for everyone to hear
when you're the one in the wrong?

7
00:00:14,395 --> 00:00:17,686
What did I do wrong?
You think I'm seeing Do Hee's boyfriend?

8
00:00:18,186 --> 00:00:19,395
Don't be ridiculous.

9
00:00:19,436 --> 00:00:22,770
Whether it's true or not,
Do Hee has turned it into a problem.

10
00:00:22,811 --> 00:00:25,465
Focus on your own life, Mom,
and stay away from that doctor.

11
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:27,519
- Na Ji Ni.
- No matter what nonsense Do Hee said,

12
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:29,186
you should've believed me, Mom.

13
00:00:29,561 --> 00:00:31,145
I don't even want to hear about dating.

14
00:00:31,395 --> 00:00:35,270
I told you. I hate dad's love life,
and yours is no different.

15
00:00:35,895 --> 00:00:37,520
You think I'd date another woman's man?

16
00:00:39,027 --> 00:00:42,873
Stay alive until I find a man
I'm crazy about,

17
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:45,686
because that day will never come.

18
00:00:46,252 --> 00:00:47,263
Fine, then.

19
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,311
I'm sorry I misunderstood.

20
00:00:51,694 --> 00:00:53,145
I hate you the most, Mom.

21
00:00:54,895 --> 00:00:56,020
Look.

22
00:00:56,520 --> 00:00:59,037
Yeong Ju's brother hit me again today.

23
00:00:59,145 --> 00:01:01,895
Even after 30 years,
people still judge me.

24
00:01:03,107 --> 00:01:06,648
You think my heart didn't race
when I saw this photo?

25
00:01:06,895 --> 00:01:09,061
My mind went blank, you brat!

26
00:01:12,645 --> 00:01:14,020
Be careful.

27
00:01:14,436 --> 00:01:15,936
People never let these things go.

28
00:01:48,895 --> 00:01:51,270
Mom, come here for a second.

29
00:01:55,895 --> 00:01:57,145
What happened?

30
00:01:58,106 --> 00:01:59,231
Seung Hyun left.

31
00:02:02,633 --> 00:02:07,172
Mom, I'm going away for a while
to focus on finding Mai.

32
00:02:07,459 --> 00:02:10,436
And I met that man today.

33
00:02:10,863 --> 00:02:14,363
You might feel more comfortable
while I'm away,

34
00:02:14,856 --> 00:02:17,356
so don't worry about me.
Just follow your heart.

35
00:02:17,712 --> 00:02:19,212
I'll contact you when I find Mai.

36
00:02:19,442 --> 00:02:20,733
Please don't worry.

37
00:02:21,266 --> 00:02:23,725
That man must've met Seung Hyun.

38
00:02:33,061 --> 00:02:34,561
Mom.

39
00:02:40,037 --> 00:02:41,770
Seriously...

40
00:02:54,895 --> 00:02:57,185
(Agreement. As of today, I, No Yeong Ju,
end all ties with Im Sa Bin.)

41
00:02:57,186 --> 00:02:58,770
(Signed by No Yeong Ju)

42
00:03:05,989 --> 00:03:07,323
Why did you meet my son?

43
00:03:07,566 --> 00:03:09,066
Once I said no, it should've ended there.

44
00:03:09,270 --> 00:03:11,186
Why did you meet him
and make him leave home?

45
00:03:11,395 --> 00:03:13,145
You know he's already struggling.

46
00:03:15,145 --> 00:03:17,020
- Yeong Ju.
- You know.

47
00:03:17,270 --> 00:03:21,145
I even told you
how guilty I feel toward him,

48
00:03:21,614 --> 00:03:23,864
so why did you meet him again
and cause him more pain?

49
00:03:30,561 --> 00:03:33,270
How could you sign an agreement like this?

50
00:03:37,145 --> 00:03:38,639
What else could I do?

51
00:03:39,186 --> 00:03:40,707
First you sent Il Dong,
then your sister-in-law...

52
00:03:40,895 --> 00:03:42,965
You made this whole mess, Sa Bin.

53
00:03:43,186 --> 00:03:45,310
And then you went to see Seung Hyun too...

54
00:03:45,785 --> 00:03:47,395
Why are you doing this?

55
00:03:47,895 --> 00:03:50,895
Do you want me to drive my children away
just so I can remarry?

56
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:53,248
Hold on, Yeong Ju.

57
00:03:53,895 --> 00:03:57,020
Please tell me clearly
what you're talking about.

58
00:03:57,061 --> 00:03:58,255
This relationship won't work.

59
00:03:59,020 --> 00:04:01,770
Please stay away from my children.

60
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:25,061
- What is it?
- Your next patient is here...

61
00:04:25,712 --> 00:04:28,837
Okay. Bring them in five minutes.

62
00:04:29,246 --> 00:04:30,246
Okay.

63
00:04:30,895 --> 00:04:32,270
Wait.

64
00:04:33,377 --> 00:04:35,597
I'll only see the patients
who are here now.

65
00:04:36,145 --> 00:04:39,936
Free up some time
so I can go home and come back.

66
00:04:40,836 --> 00:04:41,836
Okay.

67
00:05:12,191 --> 00:05:13,566
Come on. Cheer up.

68
00:05:14,145 --> 00:05:17,770
What do you feel like doing?
Want to go out or take a drive?

69
00:05:18,020 --> 00:05:19,338
No, thanks.

70
00:05:20,145 --> 00:05:24,739
I'm worried about Do Hee and Ji Hu,
but Sa Bin worries me even more.

71
00:05:32,311 --> 00:05:34,498
Why are you home already?
What happened at work?

72
00:05:35,171 --> 00:05:37,645
- Did you even go?
- He stayed out all night.

73
00:05:38,492 --> 00:05:40,895
Dad, I resigned.

74
00:05:40,936 --> 00:05:41,936
What?

75
00:05:46,803 --> 00:05:47,844
Follow me.

76
00:05:48,981 --> 00:05:50,272
There's nothing to discuss.

77
00:05:51,531 --> 00:05:53,531
I only got that job
because of Do Hee anyway.

78
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:54,976
Leaving was the right decision.

79
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:56,893
I want to start over from scratch.

80
00:05:56,982 --> 00:05:58,986
What? What do you want to do?

81
00:05:59,020 --> 00:06:00,436
I'll think about it and tell you.

82
00:06:01,738 --> 00:06:03,207
Why do you do whatever you want?

83
00:06:03,343 --> 00:06:05,134
Have you always been this irresponsible?

84
00:06:08,687 --> 00:06:11,770
Sun Kyung, why did you do that?

85
00:06:12,100 --> 00:06:16,516
I'm old enough to handle this myself.
Why did you go see her?

86
00:06:17,561 --> 00:06:20,143
She's already been through enough.
Why did you make it worse?

87
00:06:20,264 --> 00:06:21,555
Did I ask for your help?

88
00:06:21,770 --> 00:06:24,145
I never asked you to. Why did you do it?

89
00:06:24,270 --> 00:06:27,311
Sa Bin, I spoke to her
calmly and respectfully.

90
00:06:27,645 --> 00:06:31,145
Instead, she was the one
who shouted at me.

91
00:06:31,727 --> 00:06:35,518
She said she had no plans to marry you,
and that you were the one insisting...

92
00:06:35,520 --> 00:06:36,520
Is that true?

93
00:06:36,738 --> 00:06:38,738
- You feel that strongly about her?
- Yes, I do.

94
00:06:39,094 --> 00:06:42,178
That's what I told you.
She hasn't made up her mind yet.

95
00:06:42,309 --> 00:06:45,684
I told you all of that,
so why did you go see her?

96
00:06:46,395 --> 00:06:47,520
Honey.

97
00:06:47,914 --> 00:06:50,289
She was only trying to help you...

98
00:06:52,645 --> 00:06:56,895
I never asked for any help!
Just leave me alone!

99
00:06:58,645 --> 00:07:02,436
You were high school classmates.
Instead of standing by her,

100
00:07:02,770 --> 00:07:05,145
why are you making her suffer?

101
00:07:05,686 --> 00:07:08,645
What makes our family so much better?

102
00:07:08,811 --> 00:07:12,936
Tell me
why we're so much better than Yeong Ju.

103
00:07:13,145 --> 00:07:15,436
Sa Bin, our family...

104
00:07:15,935 --> 00:07:20,685
I have my husband and my son...

105
00:07:20,686 --> 00:07:24,186
And Yeong Ju has two sons.

106
00:07:24,746 --> 00:07:26,580
They're both more successful than him.

107
00:07:27,100 --> 00:07:30,434
My brother may be retired,
but I'll be a doctor for life.

108
00:07:30,496 --> 00:07:33,955
By your standards, money, youth, sons...

109
00:07:34,020 --> 00:07:38,186
Yeong Ju has far more than you do.

110
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:39,811
Seriously...

111
00:07:40,975 --> 00:07:43,434
Honey, say something.

112
00:07:43,436 --> 00:07:46,686
I'm about to faint from disbelief.

113
00:07:46,770 --> 00:07:52,020
What gives you the right to make her cry?

114
00:07:52,344 --> 00:07:55,969
Did you ever work for a living
the way Yeong Ju did?

115
00:07:56,145 --> 00:07:58,186
- As for Yeong Ju...
- Uncle.

116
00:07:58,645 --> 00:08:02,520
She sings well and raised two sons
by running a singing class.

117
00:08:03,061 --> 00:08:06,936
Unlike you,
she didn't spend her life doing nothing.

118
00:08:10,895 --> 00:08:13,645
You little punk!
How dare you speak to her like that?

119
00:08:14,303 --> 00:08:17,469
Who brought you meals and snacks
when you studied Korean medicine?

120
00:08:17,638 --> 00:08:20,763
Who helped you save every penny
and find that property?

121
00:08:20,927 --> 00:08:23,268
Who do you think helped you
get that building?

122
00:08:25,145 --> 00:08:26,520
None of that matters now.

123
00:08:27,462 --> 00:08:29,337
I cared so much about you...

124
00:08:32,153 --> 00:08:33,153
Sun Kyung.

125
00:08:35,547 --> 00:08:37,588
We'll talk later.

126
00:08:46,770 --> 00:08:47,770
Uncle.

127
00:08:52,844 --> 00:08:55,000
Yeong Ju's eldest son left home.

128
00:08:56,770 --> 00:08:58,645
I feel like it's all my fault.

129
00:08:59,145 --> 00:09:00,145
What?

130
00:09:01,061 --> 00:09:03,645
He left because she's marrying you?

131
00:09:04,686 --> 00:09:06,020
Not exactly,

132
00:09:07,186 --> 00:09:10,436
but she can't exactly remarry
with everything going on.

133
00:09:11,520 --> 00:09:12,906
I told you before.

134
00:09:14,770 --> 00:09:17,020
That's why I was going to wait,

135
00:09:17,395 --> 00:09:19,273
but this happened.

136
00:09:25,020 --> 00:09:26,020
Uncle.

137
00:09:50,020 --> 00:09:51,145
What are you doing?

138
00:09:52,015 --> 00:09:54,224
You said you had no appetite
and couldn't even eat porridge.

139
00:09:54,393 --> 00:09:58,145
I'll make you some fruit punch.
Have some. You need to eat something.

140
00:09:58,186 --> 00:09:59,668
You need to stay hydrated.

141
00:10:00,752 --> 00:10:02,211
I hated you, then loved you.

142
00:10:03,020 --> 00:10:05,645
Let's keep living here together.

143
00:10:05,811 --> 00:10:08,520
How can you leave
and abandon your children?

144
00:10:08,770 --> 00:10:10,145
Mom.

145
00:10:10,561 --> 00:10:11,561
Yeah?

146
00:10:17,002 --> 00:10:18,127
Yeah, this is me.

147
00:10:19,395 --> 00:10:20,436
Really?

148
00:10:21,724 --> 00:10:24,474
Okay. Where should I go?

149
00:10:29,395 --> 00:10:30,395
Here.

150
00:10:31,395 --> 00:10:32,609
Have some.

151
00:10:34,641 --> 00:10:36,639
Don't worry about what mom said.

152
00:10:36,895 --> 00:10:39,520
You really need to be happy.

153
00:10:39,686 --> 00:10:42,000
You're the only one who's on my side.

154
00:10:42,270 --> 00:10:44,770
You took care of me earlier, right?

155
00:10:45,145 --> 00:10:46,703
I didn't really do much.

156
00:10:47,259 --> 00:10:48,343
I just...

157
00:10:49,895 --> 00:10:53,401
Hey, Yeong Ju. I think I need to step out.

158
00:10:53,579 --> 00:10:56,870
Make her smile for me.
And keep an eye on her.

159
00:10:58,305 --> 00:10:59,430
Here. That's enough.

160
00:11:04,561 --> 00:11:06,922
Your mom is hilarious.

161
00:11:14,020 --> 00:11:15,770
Did she tease me again?

162
00:11:21,645 --> 00:11:23,252
You seem to be doing okay.

163
00:11:24,378 --> 00:11:25,878
This is all I could get.

164
00:11:29,020 --> 00:11:32,121
That's how sons are.
At best, they bring a bag of porridge.

165
00:11:32,580 --> 00:11:33,830
"A bag of porridge?"

166
00:11:34,186 --> 00:11:37,934
You're the only person in the world
I'd ever buy porridge for.

167
00:11:37,936 --> 00:11:39,020
You're making me feel bad.

168
00:11:39,061 --> 00:11:40,645
Yeah, thanks.

169
00:11:44,145 --> 00:11:45,145
Here you go.

170
00:11:53,745 --> 00:11:56,204
Did you go by Seung Hyun's office?

171
00:11:57,560 --> 00:11:58,895
They say he quit.

172
00:12:00,363 --> 00:12:01,447
Really?

173
00:12:02,435 --> 00:12:06,226
Looking for his wife kept
getting in the way of his work,

174
00:12:06,586 --> 00:12:07,711
so I guess he finally quit.

175
00:12:09,579 --> 00:12:11,579
What on earth is he thinking?

176
00:12:12,461 --> 00:12:16,336
I'm sure he's somewhere safe. Don't worry.

177
00:12:20,232 --> 00:12:21,808
Those who left because they hate me...

178
00:12:22,520 --> 00:12:24,645
will come crawling back
before they get far.

179
00:12:37,692 --> 00:12:38,692
Going to the cafe?

180
00:12:39,586 --> 00:12:41,252
Yes.

181
00:12:43,127 --> 00:12:44,127
Thanks.

182
00:12:45,329 --> 00:12:46,329
What?

183
00:12:47,415 --> 00:12:48,581
For taking care of my mom.

184
00:12:49,691 --> 00:12:52,441
I used to be the fun one in my family.

185
00:12:52,895 --> 00:12:54,527
Without me, it was like a temple.

186
00:12:55,686 --> 00:12:57,520
You don't seem like the fun one.

187
00:12:57,895 --> 00:13:00,395
Right? Do I look like the fun one to you?

188
00:13:03,895 --> 00:13:04,895
Goodbye.

189
00:13:16,186 --> 00:13:19,520
(Jong No Police Station)

190
00:13:25,936 --> 00:13:27,642
Maestro, what?

191
00:13:28,311 --> 00:13:31,145
Don't call me that. It's embarrassing.

192
00:13:36,645 --> 00:13:37,895
Are you okay?

193
00:13:52,485 --> 00:13:54,610
I hired a private investigator.

194
00:13:55,395 --> 00:13:57,270
I asked them
to find Attorney Byeon's home.

195
00:13:59,119 --> 00:14:03,828
I got a call, so I went over,
but he wasn't there. Just his wife.

196
00:14:04,520 --> 00:14:05,770
And she's not even his legal wife.

197
00:14:06,145 --> 00:14:09,770
I didn't know that, so I argued with her,
demanding she tell me where he was.

198
00:14:11,270 --> 00:14:13,020
That's how
I ended up at the police station.

199
00:14:15,020 --> 00:14:17,145
I can't just call Ji Ni.

200
00:14:17,520 --> 00:14:18,936
So I called you.

201
00:14:19,686 --> 00:14:20,940
You did the right thing.

202
00:14:22,136 --> 00:14:26,845
The police asked if I had any family
they could contact,

203
00:14:28,684 --> 00:14:31,434
but there wasn't really anyone to call.

204
00:14:31,519 --> 00:14:33,603
Don't go through this alone anymore.

205
00:14:34,953 --> 00:14:36,884
If things get hard, talk to me.

206
00:14:42,770 --> 00:14:43,811
Thanks.

207
00:14:47,336 --> 00:14:52,159
Na Se Ri! I don't know
how things got this bad.

208
00:14:53,877 --> 00:14:57,752
I can't even perform anymore,
and I have no money.

209
00:15:00,420 --> 00:15:03,836
It feels like
my whole life is falling apart at once.

210
00:15:04,061 --> 00:15:06,477
It's not over yet. Hang in there.

211
00:15:07,895 --> 00:15:09,694
You have to think about Ji Ni too.

212
00:15:12,270 --> 00:15:16,061
Yeah. I will. I have to stay strong.

213
00:15:24,811 --> 00:15:26,611
Thank you for everything today.

214
00:15:28,186 --> 00:15:30,395
- I'll get going.
- What?

215
00:15:35,993 --> 00:15:39,868
Cha Min Ki, you said you'd
take care of everything. What is this?

216
00:15:40,861 --> 00:15:43,277
In the end, you just left me all alone.

217
00:15:53,586 --> 00:15:56,711
Okay, this needs to feel genuine,

218
00:15:57,057 --> 00:15:59,269
but don't push your own opinion too hard.

219
00:15:59,270 --> 00:16:00,561
Ready? Let's get started.

220
00:16:00,645 --> 00:16:01,770
Wait.

221
00:16:03,020 --> 00:16:05,134
What's up with those two contestants?

222
00:16:05,686 --> 00:16:07,686
- Where?
- Those two over there.

223
00:16:08,963 --> 00:16:10,645
I expected this,

224
00:16:12,020 --> 00:16:13,163
but it's intense.

225
00:16:15,290 --> 00:16:16,635
What's with them?

226
00:16:16,770 --> 00:16:18,770
Okay, we're rolling.

227
00:16:21,270 --> 00:16:25,561
Your endlessly devoted
and friendly contestant,

228
00:16:25,645 --> 00:16:29,770
Kim Mi Sook, contestant number three.
It's a pleasure to meet you.

229
00:16:34,244 --> 00:16:35,744
Cut. Okay.

230
00:16:35,895 --> 00:16:37,770
We'll take a 15-minute break,
then move on to the next segment.

231
00:16:38,145 --> 00:16:39,936
Okay, 15-minute break.

232
00:17:05,936 --> 00:17:07,020
(Jung A)

233
00:17:41,953 --> 00:17:45,578
I knew this bitch would pull something,
so I came prepared.

234
00:17:46,145 --> 00:17:47,694
You think I'm Ji Ni, right?

235
00:17:47,770 --> 00:17:48,811
I'm not falling for it.

236
00:17:49,311 --> 00:17:51,350
I'll break your ankle.

237
00:17:54,520 --> 00:17:57,145
Jung A, you said
you're an art teacher, right?

238
00:17:59,020 --> 00:18:02,270
There's an easel over there.
Can you show us what you can do?

239
00:18:03,145 --> 00:18:06,098
How about I draw your portrait?

240
00:18:06,145 --> 00:18:07,145
Sure.

241
00:18:16,645 --> 00:18:20,268
- Jung A! Your dress is ripped.
- What?

242
00:18:20,270 --> 00:18:22,894
- I think it's too small. Let me see.
- No, it's fine.

243
00:18:22,895 --> 00:18:25,144
- How embarrassing.
- Go away. It's not embarrassing.

244
00:18:25,145 --> 00:18:27,644
- Cut!
- Go away!

245
00:18:27,645 --> 00:18:30,270
- Let me see.
- I said go away!

246
00:18:33,186 --> 00:18:35,061
Jung A, it's okay. Go change your clothes.

247
00:18:35,645 --> 00:18:38,514
Do Hee, go back to your spot.

248
00:18:39,770 --> 00:18:40,770
Okay.

249
00:18:41,145 --> 00:18:42,412
What the...

250
00:18:48,057 --> 00:18:49,182
Do Hee, you're filming outdoors, right?

251
00:18:50,017 --> 00:18:51,226
Let's start with Do Hee.

252
00:18:51,616 --> 00:18:53,491
Okay, everyone, let's head outside.

253
00:18:53,520 --> 00:18:54,936
Yes, sir.

254
00:18:58,409 --> 00:18:59,909
- You...
- What?

255
00:19:00,020 --> 00:19:01,061
Let go.

256
00:19:03,395 --> 00:19:05,311
Sir, let's go together.

257
00:19:13,395 --> 00:19:16,311
My tailbone!

258
00:19:19,645 --> 00:19:20,770
My bones...

259
00:19:21,858 --> 00:19:23,774
It hurts.

260
00:19:25,270 --> 00:19:28,895
Sir.

261
00:19:29,520 --> 00:19:35,436
I think someone did something to my shoes.

262
00:19:46,020 --> 00:19:47,811
So much for a smooth shoot.

263
00:19:48,969 --> 00:19:51,969
Come here. I can't handle this alone.

264
00:19:54,564 --> 00:19:55,605
Okay.

265
00:19:57,138 --> 00:19:59,388
Do Hee, I heard your mom is here.

266
00:20:00,645 --> 00:20:01,645
What?

267
00:20:28,767 --> 00:20:30,267
Yeah, it's me. What?

268
00:20:30,517 --> 00:20:33,517
Ji Hu, Mom's here.

269
00:20:33,723 --> 00:20:36,122
Your mom? What are you going to do?

270
00:20:36,561 --> 00:20:38,561
This is all because of you.

271
00:20:40,020 --> 00:20:41,452
She beat me half to death.

272
00:20:43,520 --> 00:20:45,848
She blames me for you quitting your job...

273
00:20:46,020 --> 00:20:47,907
and for us breaking up.

274
00:20:48,895 --> 00:20:51,222
She beat me so badly I can't even move.

275
00:20:52,645 --> 00:20:56,270
She also found out I'm on a dating show.
What am I going to do?

276
00:20:57,572 --> 00:21:00,322
Come quickly. I'm in so much pain.

277
00:21:07,877 --> 00:21:08,877
Ji Hu.

278
00:21:11,686 --> 00:21:13,145
Ji Hu, did you hang up?

279
00:21:14,145 --> 00:21:15,395
I'm not in Seoul right now.

280
00:21:15,877 --> 00:21:18,211
I came to a place I used to live
when I was young, to clear my head.

281
00:21:19,645 --> 00:21:21,009
Do Hee, don't look for me anymore.

282
00:21:21,465 --> 00:21:24,674
As I said before,
you need to break free from your parents.

283
00:21:25,189 --> 00:21:28,064
I can't do that.

284
00:21:34,417 --> 00:21:36,764
Even if I came to you,
there's nothing I can do for you.

285
00:21:38,520 --> 00:21:40,686
I'll hang up. I'm sorry.

286
00:21:57,311 --> 00:21:58,520
What are you doing here?

287
00:22:00,270 --> 00:22:02,660
What do you think? I'm waiting for my son.

288
00:22:03,686 --> 00:22:06,032
He even quit his job,
so he's probably out getting some air.

289
00:22:06,061 --> 00:22:07,645
Don't worry too much. Just wait.

290
00:22:08,517 --> 00:22:10,976
Go shopping or something.
Want me to shop for you?

291
00:22:12,722 --> 00:22:14,722
You're really enjoying this, aren't you?

292
00:22:15,895 --> 00:22:17,611
I can't reach Do Hee either.

293
00:22:18,270 --> 00:22:19,644
She'll give up too, I guess.

294
00:22:19,645 --> 00:22:21,185
We can't let that happen.

295
00:22:21,186 --> 00:22:24,520
There are no better in-laws for Ji Hu
than Do Hee's family.

296
00:22:24,561 --> 00:22:26,644
That doesn't mean
we can force them to get married.

297
00:22:26,645 --> 00:22:29,770
I'd rather have the woman
her husband left.

298
00:22:29,895 --> 00:22:32,913
"Abandoned old lady?"
You mean Sa Bin's woman.

299
00:22:33,495 --> 00:22:36,704
Ji Hu and Sa Bin both...

300
00:22:37,395 --> 00:22:39,395
I was so happy he grew up
without a rebellious phase.

301
00:22:39,520 --> 00:22:41,395
Ji Hu really was a good kid.

302
00:22:42,395 --> 00:22:44,530
Anyway, wait a few more days.

303
00:22:45,645 --> 00:22:48,808
Don't wait here like this.
Go wait comfortably in your room.

304
00:23:00,561 --> 00:23:04,032
Do Hee, this is Cha Seung Woo.

305
00:23:04,877 --> 00:23:07,877
Open the door. We need to talk.

306
00:23:09,020 --> 00:23:11,520
No, please go.

307
00:23:12,226 --> 00:23:15,476
We just started filming.
You can't do this.

308
00:23:30,270 --> 00:23:31,270
Come in.

309
00:23:46,520 --> 00:23:48,520
What happened? Did you fight?

310
00:23:50,020 --> 00:23:52,811
Did your boyfriend hit you?
Did you report him?

311
00:23:57,395 --> 00:23:59,186
You know my mom came.

312
00:24:02,314 --> 00:24:03,980
Your mom did this to you?

313
00:24:05,332 --> 00:24:07,721
Yes. I couldn't come
because of the bruises.

314
00:24:14,431 --> 00:24:16,472
But aren't you filming right now?

315
00:24:20,311 --> 00:24:22,145
How could we film without you?

316
00:24:23,245 --> 00:24:25,370
I told you. You're the star of the show.

317
00:24:25,520 --> 00:24:28,268
I'm the star. Nice.

318
00:24:29,554 --> 00:24:31,388
Then did you come here just for me?

319
00:24:32,020 --> 00:24:33,020
Yeah.

320
00:24:34,817 --> 00:24:36,248
Have you never seen someone
who's been beaten before?

321
00:24:37,061 --> 00:24:38,270
Why are you so surprised?

322
00:24:38,520 --> 00:24:40,686
How could a mother do this
to her daughter's face?

323
00:24:42,020 --> 00:24:45,270
Are you sure it was really your mom?
You're not lying, are you?

324
00:24:45,520 --> 00:24:48,520
Did she break anything?
Does anything else hurt?

325
00:24:51,936 --> 00:24:54,270
Actually, this part hurts a little.

326
00:24:55,517 --> 00:24:57,267
Let's go to the hospital. Get up.

327
00:24:57,811 --> 00:24:58,936
You need to get an X-ray.

328
00:25:01,306 --> 00:25:03,847
Then, sir, could you give me a piggyback?

329
00:25:04,686 --> 00:25:06,686
It hurts here if I lean on you.

330
00:25:10,767 --> 00:25:11,851
Let's go.

331
00:25:23,770 --> 00:25:25,895
You're so innocent.

332
00:25:26,145 --> 00:25:27,645
Are you really laughing right now?

333
00:25:28,479 --> 00:25:29,688
Should I cry instead?

334
00:25:30,395 --> 00:25:32,895
The bruises will go away. Don't worry.

335
00:25:34,024 --> 00:25:35,233
I'm used to it.

336
00:25:35,549 --> 00:25:38,465
Are you saying this isn't the first time
you've been beaten?

337
00:25:38,895 --> 00:25:41,145
Since middle school,
I've been beaten all the time.

338
00:25:41,770 --> 00:25:44,102
Since you're here,
do you want to stay for dinner?

339
00:25:46,311 --> 00:25:47,507
What should we order?

340
00:25:48,645 --> 00:25:50,564
- Do Do Hee.
- Come on.

341
00:25:51,270 --> 00:25:52,765
Don't take it so seriously.

342
00:25:54,086 --> 00:25:56,086
I'll go to the hospital tomorrow
and get the bruises treated.

343
00:25:56,520 --> 00:25:58,645
I won't let this
interfere with filming again.

344
00:26:08,130 --> 00:26:09,380
Mom!

345
00:27:29,275 --> 00:27:31,025
My mom was always cold.

346
00:27:35,385 --> 00:27:37,072
I never knew why.

347
00:27:41,645 --> 00:27:42,770
Until that day.

348
00:28:14,193 --> 00:28:17,503
(Family Register)

349
00:28:17,561 --> 00:28:18,894
Don't you hate me?

350
00:28:18,895 --> 00:28:20,935
I hope you meet
someone much better than dad...

351
00:28:20,936 --> 00:28:23,685
and live a happier life than mom did.

352
00:28:23,686 --> 00:28:26,561
What's this? Unbelievable.
How can there be that much gold?

353
00:28:26,645 --> 00:28:28,020
Grandpa must've given it to her.

354
00:28:28,061 --> 00:28:29,645
I have to get Ji Ni's share back.

355
00:28:29,686 --> 00:28:31,520
I want to be a happy woman.

356
00:28:31,561 --> 00:28:34,395
I'll make you happy.
I love you with all my heart.

357
00:28:34,645 --> 00:28:36,686
Yeong Ju, nothing's wrong, right?

358
00:28:36,811 --> 00:28:38,603
Please let everything be okay.

359
00:28:39,175 --> 00:28:41,175
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
